; CABALLERITO - sprite tiles, 8x16 sprite mode (LCDC bit 2 = 1). Drawn by pixel-artist.
; ALL FRAMES FACE RIGHT. Facing left = same tiles with S_FLIPX and the two 8-px columns swapped.
;
; 8x16 hardware rule: a sprite shows tile N (even) on top and N+1 below. Every piece below
; starts at an even index.
; 16x16 frame at label NAME (4 tiles):  NAME+0 left-top, NAME+1 left-bottom,
;                                        NAME+2 right-top, NAME+3 right-bottom
;   => sprite A (x, y) tile NAME, sprite B (x+8, y) tile NAME+2.
;   flipped (facing left): sprite A (x, y) tile NAME+2 S_FLIPX, sprite B (x+8, y) tile NAME S_FLIPX.
; 8x16 piece at label NAME (2 tiles): NAME+0 top, NAME+1 bottom (blank for 8x8 objects).
;
; Teo BIG / SHOT is 16x32 = an upper half (TEO_BIG_TOP*) over a lower half (TEO_BIG_BOT*),
; each half a 16x16 frame as above (4 sprites: top-left, top-right at y; bottom-left,
; bottom-right at y+16). Any TOP combines with any BOT. Suggested combos:
;   idle  TOP + BOT_IDLE      walk  TOP + BOT_WALK1/BOT_IDLE/BOT_WALK2/BOT_IDLE (8 f each)
;   jump  TOP_JUMP + BOT_JUMP skid  TOP_SKID + BOT_SKID   throw TOP_THROW + current BOT (8 f)
;   crouch: TEO_BIG_CROUCH is a full 16x16 frame drawn at y+16 (hitbox 3,18 / 10x14).
; SHOT form = the same tiles with OBP1. Art is drawn to read with OBP0 = 0xE4 (normal) and
; OBP1 = 0xD8 (shades 1 and 2 swapped: dark helmet, light armour = "armadura encantada").
; Teo SMALL walk: WALK1, IDLE, WALK2, IDLE ... (8 f each). SKID faces the pressed direction
; (drawn: facing right while still sliding left, feet braced to the left).
; Limo walk = LIMO_WALK toggling S_FLIPX every 8 f. Armadin walk = WALK1/WALK2 every 8 f.
; Armadin ball (still / kicked) = ARMADIN_BALL; kicked: toggle S_FLIPX every 4 f to fake rolling.
; ARMADIN_PEEK alternates with ARMADIN_BALL every 4 f while it trembles.
; Death "volteado" for enemies = their frame with S_FLIPY.
; COIN_SPIN0..2 (block coin, 8x16 each): play 0,1,2,1(S_FLIPX) every 4 f.
; DEBRIS: 8x8 in a pair with a blank bottom; rotate by toggling S_FLIPX / S_FLIPY.
; CHISPA (spark): 8x8 + blank; spin by cycling flips (none, X, XY, Y) every 4 f. PUF: hit puff 8 f.
; ESTANDARTE: banner cloth 16x16; its right edge touches the pole (draw at pole_x - 16 + 6).

